    "product_info_tabs": {
      "type": "section-product-info-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_details": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "DETAILS & SPECIFICATIONS",
            "heading": "The Finer Details",
            "icon": "info",
            "content": "<p>Crafted for the modern minimalist. Every Aurea piece is designed to combine timeless elegance with everyday durability.</p><p><strong>Material:</strong> 18K Gold Plated on Premium Stainless Steel (PVD Coated).</p><p><strong>Durability:</strong> 100% Tarnish-Free. Water, Sweat, and Heat Resistant.</p><p><strong>Hypoallergenic:</strong> No nickel, no lead. Safe for sensitive skin.</p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> Designed for all-day comfort.</p><p><strong>Packaging:</strong> Comes in our signature eco-friendly luxury pouch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_delivery": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "DELIVERY & RETURNS",
            "heading": "Shipping & Pre-order",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>As an independent studio, we operate in small batches to ensure the highest quality and minimize waste.</p><p><strong>Processing Time:</strong> Due to high demand, please allow 7-12 working days for your order to be prepared and dispatched.</p><p><strong>UK Delivery:</strong> Sent via Royal Mail (Tracked). Arrives in 2-3 days after dispatch.</p><p><strong>Returns:</strong> We offer a 14-day return window for unworn items.</p><p><strong>Worth the Wait:</strong> Good things take time. We promise it will be worth it. ✨</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_quality": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "QUALITY & MATERIALS",
            "heading": "Our Promise",
            "icon": "diamond",
            "content": "<p>Quality is non-negotiable. Unlike standard fashion jewelry, Aurea pieces are designed to last.</p><p><strong>Waterproof Technology:</strong> We use advanced PVD Plating technology. This ensures the gold color is bonded to the metal, making it vibrant and resistant to fading—even in the shower or gym.</p><p><strong>Skin Friendly:</strong> No green necks, ever.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> We stand by our quality with a 2-Year Color Warranty. If it fades, we replace it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_care": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "JEWELLERY CARE",
            "heading": "Love Your Jewelry",
            "icon": "heart",
            "content": "<p>While our pieces are crafted from durable Stainless Steel and designed to be water-resistant, a little love goes a long way.</p><p><strong>The Golden Rule:</strong> Last on, first off. Put your jewelry on after applying perfumes, lotions, or hairspray.</p><p><strong>Keep it Clean:</strong> Gently wipe your pieces with a soft cloth after wear to remove natural oils.</p><p><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in your Aurea pouch or a dry jewelry box to prevent scratches.</p><p><strong>Chemicals:</strong> Avoid direct contact with bleach or strong cleaning agents to maintain the shine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_gifting": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "GIFTING OPTIONS",
            "heading": "Unboxing Experience",
            "icon": "gift",
            "content": "<p>As the home of personalised gifting, we believe in creating moments that show just how much you care.</p><p><strong>Gift-Ready:</strong> Every Aurea piece comes wrapped with love in our recyclable luxury packaging.</p><p><strong>No Price Tags:</strong> We do not include invoices or price tags inside the package, so you can ship directly to your loved one with peace of mind.</p><p><strong>Free Personalised Note:</strong> Want to make it extra special? Simply leave a note at checkout (\"Order Note\"), and we will print your custom message on a card and include it in the box—completely free of charge. ✨</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_details",
        "tab_delivery",
        "tab_quality",
        "tab_care",
        "tab_gifting"
      ],
